    description: Some("Amazon Managed Service for Apache Flink was previously known as Amazon Kinesis Data Analytics for Apache Flink.  Amazon Managed Service for Apache Flink is a fully managed service that you can use to process and analyze streaming data using Java, Python, SQL, or Scala. The service enables you to quickly author and run Java, SQL, or Scala code against streaming sources to perform time series analytics, feed real-time dashboards, and create real-time metrics"),
